## 🎯 What this plugin does

`scte_{{ plugin_name }}.py` is a Python SCTE-35 handler loaded by the Uplynk
LiveSlicer at startup. 📡 When the slicer receives a SCTE-35 message on its
input, it hands the parsed message to this plugin, which decides what to do:
fire an ad break, resolve a slate, log the signal for analysis, dispatch an
external API call, or ignore it.

