# 👥 End-user guide

## 📦 Installation

1. 📤 Copy `scte_{{ plugin_name }}.py` to the slicer's plugin directory:

~~bash
scp scte_{{ plugin_name }}.py user@slicer:/opt/uplynk/plugins/
~~

2. 🔐 Set permissions:

~~bash
ssh user@slicer 'chmod 644 /opt/uplynk/plugins/scte_{{ plugin_name }}.py'
~~

3. 📝 Place `uplynk.conf` at the slicer's config path (typically `/etc/uplynk/uplynk.conf`).
   Edit it first — see [⚙️ Configuration](#️-configuration).

4. 🔄 Restart the slicer service so it picks up the new plugin and config:

~~bash
ssh user@slicer 'sudo systemctl restart uplynk-slicer'
~~

